  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. Cut tofu into 1-inch cubes and place in a shallow dish.",
    "3. Drizzle with olive oil and sprinkle with Greek seasoning. Toss to coat.",
    "4. Grill tofu for 3-4 minutes per side, or until golden brown.",
    "5. Warm pita bread by wrapping it in foil and heating it in the oven for 5 minutes.",
    "6. Assemble gyro by spreading tzatziki sauce on the pita, followed by grilled tofu, juicy tomatoes, cucumber, red onion, and Kalamata olives.",
    "7. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
